<div id="A5.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For the user prompt, we append additional instructions shown below after the motion trajectory prompt. At the end, we instruct the LLM to produce five diverse animations following the diversity prompting strategy <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib24" title="" class="ltx_ref">35</a>]</cite>.</p>
