 ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">is</span><span id="lstnumberx26.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx26.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">less</span><span id="lstnumberx26.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx26.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">than</span><span id="lstnumberx26.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx26.43" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">0.10.</span>
